    <Notes ShowOnLoad="1" Notes="Coupon 4, low energy. Fills: power x speed at 4 passes, 40kHz, 200ns, 0.05mm, hatch +13. Run 3 showed 100% power is far too much and that speed is the dominant variable. Holes and cuts start much lower: run 3 caught fire at 24 passes. Air assist ON. Judge the fills from the BACK and with a meter."/>
